    - target: {fileID: 5173840136924355948, guid: 8fb93ab98af5ba244baf1839eb3d3d82, type: 3}
      propertyPath: languageStruct.Array.data[37].english
      value: Called the sea eel it is characterized by regular white spots along
        its lateral line on the body active at night and is a healthy food source
        rich in Vitamin A.
