    - target: {fileID: 5173840136924355948, guid: 8fb93ab98af5ba244baf1839eb3d3d82, type: 3}
      propertyPath: languageStruct.Array.data[39].english
      value: Characterized by a yellow body with vivid blue spots the bluespotted
        ribbontail ray has a venomous sting on its tail and primarily inhabits coral
        reefs or shallow sandy bottoms in tropical and subtropical waters.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
