      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5173840136924355948, guid: 8fb93ab98af5ba244baf1839eb3d3d82, type: 3}
      propertyPath: languageStruct.Array.data[41].english
      value: The largest moray eel in the world it grows over 3 meters long and is
        a top nocturnal predator in the coral reef ecosystem possessing a powerful
        jaw and sharp teeth.
